            "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Create a finished high-quality unique CLEAN BACKGROUND PLATE for portrait4:5 jigsaw puzzle illustration \"A wooden pier with a fishing basket and rope coils\". Premium cozy travel-game storybook digital painting matching approved Art Direction V2 gameplay art: tactile subtly brushed surfaces, fine hand-painted detail, believable dimensional objects, gentle upper-left sunlight, rich color separation and small discoveries. NOT flat vector, NOT photorealistic, NOT generic procedural art. A sheltered wooden pier with warm terracotta and reddish-brown weathered planks occupying most of the image. A fishing basket, carefully coiled rope, clay pot with dune grasses and a small glimpse of blue water. No person, fish catch, readable label or destination landmark. Warm red-brown deck is dominant. Viewpoint: wide intimate view from slightly above. The picture must fill the entire portrait4:5 canvas, ideal1280x1600; no borders, text, UI, grid, title, logo, watermark or transparent holes. This is a complete naturally composed environment with real stable anchors for five small moving details later added as separate alpha layers. Do not add floating decorative particles or overlay patterns. Preserve coherent scale and perspective. No famous destination landmark. Keep the requested main color visible throughout the scene, not only a tiny accent.",
