            "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. A production RGBA transparent sprite atlas of five unique painted details belonging to the scene \"A wooden pier with a fishing basket and rope coils\". Match a premium cozy illustrated puzzle: rich dimensional storybook digital painting, subtle brushed pigment, believable natural forms, fine detail, soft upper-left sun, coherent warm light and tactile materials. No flat vector, no photos, no generic geometric particles. EXACTLY five isolated objects, strict3 columns by2 rows, landscape3:2 canvas. Leave the sixth bottom-right cell perfectly empty transparent. TRUE alpha transparency, no matte, no background, no grid or cell borders, no frame, no shadow rectangle, no labels or text. Place each entire object inside the central50% of its own cell, leaving wide25% gutters on every side. FULL complete loops, stems, wings, wisps and thin strands must fit safely inside each cell; none may touch canvas or cell edges. Top row left to right: a slim tuft of ochre-green dune grass with flexible seed heads and one tapered lower base; a little cluster of white sea-daisy flowers on a slim green lower stem; a short curly amber seaweed ribbon hanging downward from a thin top stem. Bottom row left to right: one small pale-grey gull feather with a warm ivory central shaft, resting diagonally; one small dark-red shore crab viewed overhead, complete naturally painted legs and claws, no ground rectangle; EMPTY. Preserve detailed painted alpha edges and translucent material where specified. Do not include containers, scenery or extra items. All five details are real meaningful parts of this specific scene, sharing its scale and light.",
